### Base URL and auth token placeholder
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api
@token = YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE

### Create a lot
POST {{baseUrl}}/lots
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": "PRODUCT_UUID",
  "lotNumber": "LOT-001",
  "expiryDate": "2027-12-31",
  "initialQty": 100
}

### List lots by product
GET {{baseUrl}}/lots/product/PRODUCT_UUID?includeVoided=false
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Expiry dashboard
GET {{baseUrl}}/lots/expiry-dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Traceability by lot number
GET {{baseUrl}}/lots/traceability/LOT-001
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Correct a lot (typo only)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lots/LOT_UUID
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "lotNumber": "LOT-001-CORRECTED",
  "reason": "Typo correction"
}

### Void a lot
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/lots/LOT_UUID/void
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "reason": "Created by mistake"
}

### Deduct stock via FEFO
POST {{baseUrl}}/lots/fefo/deduct
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

{
  "productId": "PRODUCT_UUID",
  "quantity": 10
}

### Current alerts snapshot
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### SSE alerts stream
GET {{baseUrl}}/alerts/stream
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
